# Stage trees are GENERATED: stage_N = transformer(stage_N-1), reproducible by
#   PYTHONSAFEPATH=1 .venv/bin/python recon/refactor/driver.py materialize N
# and fully pinned by the committed MANIFEST.json (every input path + input
# SHA-256 + output SHA-256).  They are ~17 MB and ~1,800 relative symlinks each,
# which would swamp every diff for zero information.
#
# Committed instead, and deliberately: MANIFEST.json, PARITY_MAP.json,
# QUARANTINE.json -- the evidence that a stage produced what it says it produced.
stage_*/tree/
__pycache__/
